{"status":"ready","content":"<think>\r\nCompute char poly of A. p(λ) = det(λI - A).\r\n\r\nTrace = -4+10-14 = -8. So coefficient: λ³ - (trace)λ² + ... = λ³ + 8λ² + ...\r\n\r\nSum of 2x2 principal minors:\r\nM1 (rows/cols 2,3): |10,4;-5,-14| = -140+20 = -120\r\nM2 (rows/cols 1,3): |-4,10;12,-14| = 56-120 = -64\r\nM3 (rows/cols 1,2): |-4,-13;-9,10| = -40-117 = -157\r\nSum = -120-64-157 = -341\r\n\r\nCoefficient of λ: -341... wait, char poly λ³ - tr·λ² + (sum minors)λ - det.\r\nSo λ³ +8λ² -341λ - det(A).\r\n\r\ndet(A): \r\n-4*(10*(-14) - 4*(-5)) - (-13)*((-9)*(-14) - 4*12) + 10*((-9)*(-5) - 10*12)\r\n= -4*(-140+20) +13*(126-48) +10*(45-120)\r\n= -4*(-120) +13*78 +10*(-75)\r\n= 480 + 1014 -750\r\n= 744\r\n\r\nSo char poly = λ³ + 8λ² - 341λ - 744.\r\n</think>\r\n\r\n$$\\boxed{\\lambda^3+8\\lambda^2-341\\lambda-744}$$\r\n","path":"responses/claude-opus-4-7/livebench-029-math.txt","size":771,"mtime":1779367563}